## Why This Is Asked
This tests ability to design governance for cross-team experimentation, balancing speed with reliability and data integrity.

## Key Concepts
- KPI ownership and charter
- Preflight power analysis and data-quality gates
- Guardrails: latency, error rate, quotas
- Feature flags, canary and cohort rollouts
- Artifacts: experiment charter, data map, rollback plan

## Code Example
```javascript
function shouldRollout(experiment, metrics) {
  const {power, mde, dataQuality} = metrics;
  if (!experiment.flagsEnabled) return false;
  if (power < experiment.requiredPower) return false;
  if (!dataQuality.ok) return false;
  if (metrics.latency > experiment.maxLatency) return false;
  return true;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would thresholds vary by product area?
- How would you measure guardrail impact on velocity and reliability?

## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to manage dependency risk, reliability, and governance during a real vendor outage and migration. Candidate must balance rapid stabilization with a long-term strategy that minimizes disruption and preserves velocity.

## Key Concepts
- Dependency risk management with a vendor service
- Reliability-focused migration planning
- Cross-team governance (telemetry, incidents, release engineering)
- Metrics and guardrails to avoid gaming

## Code Example
```javascript
class SimpleCB {
  constructor() {
    this.state = 'CLOSED';
    this.failures = 0;
  }
  async call(fn, timeout = 5000) {
    if (this.state === 'OPEN') throw new Error('Circuit open');
    try {
      const t = new Promise(res => setTimeout(res, timeout, 'timeout'));
      const r = await Promise.race([fn(), t]);
      if (r === 'timeout') throw new Error('timeout');
      this.failures = 0;
      return r;
    } catch (e) {
      this.failures++;
      if (this.failures > 2) this.state = 'OPEN';
      throw e;
    }
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you communicate progress and risks to leadership?
- What experiments would you run to validate readiness and measure impact?
